e\">A signed analysis is on file:</span>\n  <a href=\"/p/canadian-polling-industry?mode=signed\">Read it →</a>\n  <div class=\"meta\" style=\"flex-basis:100%;margin-top:4px\">\"The Canadian polling industry operates with relatively weak oversight and a dominant market player.\"</div>\n</div>\n  \n  \n  <header class=\"subject-head\">\n    <div class=\"stamp\">\n  <div class=\"stamp-top\"><span class=\"fileno\">FILE ON CANADIAN POLLING INDUSTRY</span><span class=\"kindchip\">Company</span></div>\n  <div class=\"stamp-body\">\n    <h1>Canadian polling industry</h1>\n    <p class=\"desig\">7.3 million advance-ballot voters in 2025<a class=\"qref\" href=\"/q/31687d18-7917-4e92-869a-4867ba3c11aa\" title=\"7.3 million advance-ballot voters (a 25% increase over 2021)\"><sup>1</sup></a>. Canadian opt-in panels have few rural respondents<a class=\"qref\" href=\"/q/3d8362b9-bf1c-4cfe-8eed-105e07ff95e6\" title=\"Canadian opt-in panels have so few of these respondents that the weights become extreme\"><sup>2</sup></a>.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stamp-foot\"><div class=\"coord\"><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#on-file\">3 SOURCES</a> <span class=\"sep\">·</span> <a class=\"jump\" href=\"#on-the-record\">5 DOCUMENTED FACTS</a> <span class=\"sep\">·</span> <a class=\"jump\" href=\"#disputed\">2 DISPUTED</a> <span class=\"sep\">·</span> OPENED 2026-07-22 <span class=\"sep\">·</span> UPDATED <span class=\"hi\">2026-07-22</span> <span class=\"sep\">·</span> <a class=\"jump ac\" href=\"/p/canadian-polling-industry?mode=signed\">SIGNED ANALYSIS ON FILE</a></div></div>\n</div>\n    \n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"subject-grid\">\n    <div class=\"subject-main\">\n      \n      <section id=\"on-the-record\" data-schema=\"ItemList\"><div class=\"sec-k\">On the record <a class=\"sec-standalone\" href=\"/profile/canadian-polling-industry\">see profile →</a></div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-d8db2f47-37d2-46e8-9f04-410aab5c85f0\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">7.3 million advance-ballot voters in 2025</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Pass 2: The Forensics, the Math, and the Philosophy of Canad</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“7.3 million advance-ballot voters (a 25% increase over 2021)”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-1809f64b-fe24-40e7-88ac-2f94c69ab99d-text-markdown\">Pass 2: The Forensics, the Math, and the Philosophy of Canad</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-63ccbbde-ce02-48c5-8e83-5c4a0dded8f5\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">Canadian opt-in panels have few rural respondents</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Pass 2: The Forensics, the Math, and the Philosophy of Canad</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“Canadian opt-in panels have so few of these respondents that the weights become extreme”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-1809f64b-fe24-40e7-88ac-2f94c69ab99d-text-markdown\">Pass 2: The Forensics, the Math, and the Philosophy of Canad</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-fe3e5c36-814d-45f7-86d9-c0cf40e4eb6b\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">338Canada is a single dominant aggregator</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">PASS 4 — The Researchers, The Natural Experiments, and the T</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“a single dominant aggregator (338Canada)”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><sp